   "comments": [
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:e25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Chris Wilper",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "[Followup from Sourceforge Tracker]",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Followup Submitter: sjw46",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Logged In: YES ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "user_id=1709161",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Originator: YES",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This problem manifests itself when policy enforcement is active and you ingest ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "an object that contains a malformed/invalid policy in the object's POLICY ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "datastream. The object will ingest without any errors, but once ingested you ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "are unable to access the object by either API-A or API-M because of an ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "authZException.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The authZException is actually masking the underlying cause of the exception ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "which is a ValidationException thrown by the parser when unable to ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "successfully parse the malformed policy. Repository wide policies are ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "validated at server startup, but policies embedded in an object's POLICY ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "datastream are not parsed until an attempt is made to access the object.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "A temporary workaround should this occur is:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "1) shutdown the Fedora server",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "2) edit fedora.fcfg and set the \"ENFORCE-MODE\" parameter to \"permit-all-",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "requests\"",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "3) restart the server",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "4) edit/remove the object with the malformed policy",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "5) shutdown the server",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "6) edit fedora.fcfg and set \"ENFORCE-MODE\" parameter back to \"enforce-policies\"",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "7) restart the server",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "------- Additional Comment #1 From Ross Wayland 2006-04-21 17:18 [reply] ------- ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "The proper fix for this problem is probably to just parse POLICY datastream ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "policies at the time of ingest and throw an exception if the policy is ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "invalid. Catching the problem at ingest time would prevent the object from ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "being added to the repository.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This will have some impact on ingest performance, so needs to be evaluated ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "before implementing a permanent fix.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
