  "description": "<p>Validation for POLICY datastreams only occurs when they're read for the purpose of enforcement (after they're ingested).  This makes it possible to ingest a non-schema-valid POLICY datastream, which then makes it impossible to access the object at all due to validation failures for every subsequence API operation involving the object.</p>",
